sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant Z as CompressionDecorator
  participant E as EncryptionDecorator
  participant M as MemoryDataSource
  Note over C,M: source = Compression(Encryption(Memory))
  C->>Z: writeData("texto")
  Z->>Z: comprime (gzip + base64)
  Z->>E: writeData(comprimido)
  E->>E: criptografa (AES-256-GCM)
  E->>M: writeData(criptografado)
  C->>Z: readData()
  Z->>E: readData()
  E->>M: readData()
  M-->>E: criptografado
  E-->>Z: descriptografa e devolve
  Z-->>C: descomprime e devolve "texto"
